{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05345","headline":"塞外三首 二 · 郑愔","name":"塞外三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒垒三秋夕，穷郊万里平。\n海阴凝独树，日气下连营。\n戎斾霜旋重，边裘夜更轻。\n将军犹转战，都尉不成名。\n折柳悲春曲，吹笳断夜声。\n明年汉使返，须筑受降城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}